  "description": "A powerful .NET configuration provider for Google Cloud Secret Manager that enables seamless secret management in your applications. Features include region-specific secret handling, flexible filtering options, batch processing, automatic secret rotation, built-in retry policies, and JSON value flattening support. Perfect for cloud-native applications requiring secure and scalable secret management.",
